---
import Button from "../atoms/Button.astro";
---

<section>
  <div class="about-golden">
    <div class="marquee">
      <div>
        <p class="marquee-item">What is Golden Era?</p>
        <p class="marquee-item">What is Golden Era?</p>
        <p class="marquee-item">What is Golden Era?</p>
      </div>
      <div aria-hidden="true">
        <p class="marquee-item">What is Golden Era?</p>
        <p class="marquee-item">What is Golden Era?</p>
        <p class="marquee-item">What is Golden Era?</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="about-era">
      <hr class="about-hr" />
      <div class="about-content">
        <p>
          En Golden Era se han realizado proyectos innovadores que responden a
          las necesidades de nuestros clientes y a los deseos de su audiencia.
        </p>
        <p>
          Nos gusta decir que convertimos lo salvaje, ambicioso y experimental
          en realidad, pero puedes ser tú quien lo juzgue. Generamos engagement,
          comprensión y acción en cada experiencia que creamos.
        </p>
        <Button href="/contacto" text="Contacta" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-golden {
    position: relative;
    height: 85rem;
  }
  .about-era {
    position: absolute;
    top: 30rem;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: end;
    gap: 4rem;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .about-hr {
    width: 15rem;
    height: 0;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-primary-500);
  }

  .about-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding-right: clamp(2.5rem, 10%, 10rem);
    gap: 2rem;
    width: 30%;
  }

  .about-content p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--font-size-large);
    color: var(--color-white);
    line-height: 4rem;
  }

  .marquee {
    overflow: clip;
    user-select: none;
    --gap: 80px;
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--gap);
  }
  .marquee div {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    min-width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--gap);

    animation: scroll 60s linear infinite;
  }

  .marquee div p {
    font-size: clamp(15rem, 20vw, 50rem);

    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: -1rem;
    font-family: "NewTitle";
    color: var(--color-primary-500);
    filter: opacity(0.2);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /*  .marquee:hover div {
    animation-play-state: paused;
  } */

  @keyframes scroll {
    to {
      transform: translateX(calc(-100% - var(--gap)));
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 1800px) {
    .about-era {
      top: 25rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 1500px) {
    .about-era {
      top: 20rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 1100px) {
    .about-era {
      justify-content: flex-start;
      top: 10rem;
    }

    .about-hr {
      margin-left: 1.2rem;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }

    .about-content {
      width: 100%;
      padding-right: 1rem;
    }

    .about-content p{
        width: 80%;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-golden {
      height: 45rem;
    }

    .about-era {
      top: 10rem;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
    .about-hr {
      margin-left: 1rem;
      width: 10rem;
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }

    .about-content p {
      font-size: var(--font-size-medium);
      line-height: normal;
    }

    .marquee div p {
      letter-spacing: normal;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {

    .about-hr {
      margin-left: 0.5rem;
      width: 5rem;
    }

    .marquee div {
      animation: scroll 30s linear infinite;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 400px) {
    .about-golden {
      height: 50rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 340px) {
    .about-golden {
      height: 60rem;
    }
  }
</style>
